---
---
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/icon_magda.svg" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="description" content="Blindmate Premium — Case Study by Magdalena Szymaniec" />
    <title>Blindmate Premium — Magdalena Szymaniec</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Lora:wght@600&family=DM+Sans:wght@400;600&family=Gentium+Plus:wght@700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
    <style>
      *, *::before, *::after {
        box-sizing: border-box;
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
      }

      @keyframes page-fade-in {
        from { opacity: 0; }
        to   { opacity: 1; }
      }

      body {
        font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
        background-color: #f7f6fa;
        color: #302b36;
        min-height: 100vh;
        animation: page-fade-in 0.35s ease both;
      }

      a:not(.nav-link):not(.nav-identity) {
        color: #302b36;
        text-decoration: underline;
        text-underline-offset: 3px;
        text-decoration-thickness: 1px;
        text-decoration-color: #c8c5d0;
        transition: color 0.15s ease, text-decoration-color 0.15s ease;
      }

      a:not(.nav-link):not(.nav-identity):hover {
        color: #9b90cc;
        text-decoration-color: #9b90cc;
      }

      /* ── Nav ── */
      nav {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        align-items: center;
        padding: 12px 24px;
        background-color: #f7f6fa;
        position: sticky;
        top: 0;
        z-index: 50;
      }

      .nav-identity {
        display: none;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 10px;
        text-decoration: none;
        color: #302b36;
      }

      .nav-name {
        font-size: 0.875rem;
        font-weight: 600;
      }

      .nav-links {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 4px;
      }

      .nav-link {
        font-size: 0.875rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        color: #827d87;
        text-decoration: none;
        padding: 5px 14px;
        border-radius: 999px;
        transition: color 0.2s ease, background-color 0.2s ease;
      }

      .nav-link:hover { color: #302b36; }

      .nav-link.active {
        background-color: #9b90cc;
        color: #ffffff;
      }

      .nav-link.active:hover { background-color: #8778bc; }

      /* ── Header ── */
      .cs-header {
        padding: 40px 24px 32px;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 16px;
      }

      .cs-year {
        font-size: 0.8125rem;
        color: #827d87;
      }

      .cs-title {
        font-family: 'Lora', serif;
        font-size: 2rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        color: #302b36;
        line-height: 1.2;
      }

      .cs-tags {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 8px;
        align-items: center;
      }

      .tag {
        display: inline-block;
        background-color: #eae5fc;
        color: #302b36;
        font-size: 0.8125rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        padding: 4px 14px;
        border-radius: 999px;
      }

      .tag--meta {
        background-color: transparent;
        color: #827d87;
        font-weight: 400;
        padding-left: 0;
      }

      /* ── Body ── */
      .cs-body {
        padding: 8px 24px 64px;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 40px;
      }

      .cs-section {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 12px;
      }

      .cs-section-title {
        font-family: 'Lora', serif;
        font-size: 1.25rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        color: #302b36;
        line-height: 1.3;
      }

      .body-text {
        font-size: 0.9375rem;
        color: #302b36;
        line-height: 1.6;
      }

      .body-list {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 6px;
        padding-left: 20px;
      }

      .body-list li {
        font-size: 0.9375rem;
        color: #302b36;
        line-height: 1.6;
      }

      /* ── Tooltip terms ── */
      .glossary-term {
        position: relative;
        display: inline;
        text-decoration: underline;
        text-decoration-style: dotted;
        text-underline-offset: 3px;
        cursor: help;
        white-space: nowrap;
      }

      .glossary-tip {
        display: none;
        position: absolute;
        bottom: calc(100% + 8px);
        left: 50%;
        transform: translateX(-50%);
        background-color: #302b36;
        color: #ffffff;
        font-size: 0.8125rem;
        font-weight: 400;
        font-style: normal;
        line-height: 1.5;
        padding: 10px 16px;
        border-radius: 6px;
        white-space: normal;
        max-width: 300px;
        width: max-content;
        text-align: center;
        pointer-events: none;
        z-index: 20;
      }

      @media (hover: hover) {
        .glossary-term:hover .glossary-tip { display: block; }
      }

      /* ── Mobile Glossary popup ── */
      :global(#glossary-popup-overlay) {
        display: none;
        position: fixed;
        inset: 0;
        z-index: 60;
        background: transparent;
      }

      :global(#glossary-popup) {
        position: fixed;
        bottom: 0;
        left: 0;
        right: 0;
        background: #ffffff;
        border-radius: 16px 16px 0 0;
        padding: 16px 24px 40px;
        transform: translateY(100%);
        transition: transform 0.28s cubic-bezier(0.32, 0.72, 0, 1);
        z-index: 61;
      }

      :global(#glossary-popup.open) { transform: translateY(0); }
      :global(#glossary-popup-overlay.open) { display: block; }

      @media (hover: hover) {
        :global(#glossary-popup), :global(#glossary-popup-overlay) { display: none !important; }
      }

      .popup-handle {
        width: 36px;
        height: 4px;
        background-color: #d8d2f0;
        border-radius: 2px;
        margin: 0 auto 16px;
      }

      .popup-label {
        font-size: 0.9375rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        color: #302b36;
        margin-bottom: 8px;
      }

      .popup-text {
        font-size: 0.9375rem;
        color: #302b36;
        line-height: 1.6;
      }

      /* ── TL;DR box ── */
      .tldr-box {
        margin: 0 -24px;
        padding: 24px;
        background-color: #eae5fc;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 12px;
      }

      .tldr-title {
        font-size: 1rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        color: #302b36;
      }

      .tldr-box p {
        max-width: 68ch;
      }

      .tldr-columns {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 12px;
      }

      .tldr-left {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 12px;
      }

      .meta-list {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 6px;
      }

      .meta-item {
        font-size: 0.9375rem;
        color: #302b36;
        line-height: 1.55;
      }

      /* ── Stats ── */
      .stat-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
        gap: 20px;
        padding: 8px 0;
      }

      .stat-number {
        display: block;
        font-family: 'Lora', serif;
        font-size: 2rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        color: #302b36;
        line-height: 1;
      }

      .stat-label {
        display: block;
        font-size: 0.875rem;
        color: #827d87;
        line-height: 1.4;
        margin-top: 4px;
      }

      /* ── Image frame ── */
      .img-frame {
        margin: 0 -24px;
        background-color: #f3f1fe;
        border-top: 1px solid #d8d2f0;
        border-bottom: 1px solid #d8d2f0;
        padding: 24px;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 0;
      }

      .wide-img {
        width: 100%;
        height: auto;
        display: block;
      }

      .img-caption {
        font-size: 0.8125rem;
        color: #827d87;
        margin-top: 20px;
        line-height: 1.5;
      }

      .img-caption--center {
        text-align: center;
      }

      /* ── Bullet list ── */
      .bullet-list {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 6px;
        padding-left: 20px;
      }

      .bullet-list li {
        font-size: 0.9375rem;
        color: #302b36;
        line-height: 1.6;
      }

      /* ── Carousel ── */
      .cs-carousel-frame {
        margin: 0 -24px;
        background-color: #f3f1fe;
        border-top: 1px solid #d8d2f0;
        border-bottom: 1px solid #d8d2f0;
        overflow: hidden;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 20px;
        padding: 24px 0 28px;
      }

      .cs-carousel {
        width: 100%;
        overflow: hidden;
      }

      .cs-carousel-track {
        display: flex;
        transition: transform 0.35s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
        will-change: transform;
      }

      .cs-slide {
        flex: 0 0 100%;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 20px;
        padding: 0 24px;
      }

      .cs-slide-text {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 6px;
        align-self: flex-start;
      }

      .cs-slide-title {
        font-family: 'Lora', serif;
        font-size: 1.0625rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        color: #302b36;
        line-height: 1.3;
      }

      .cs-slide-desc {
        font-size: 0.875rem;
        color: #302b36;
        line-height: 1.55;
        max-width: 36ch;
      }

      .cs-slide img {
        width: 100%;
        max-width: 360px;
        aspect-ratio: 1 / 1;
        object-fit: contain;
        display: block;
        cursor: pointer;
      }

      /* Carousel arrows */
      .cs-carousel-arrow {
        display: none;
      }

      /* Pill indicator */
      .cs-dots {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 6px;
        background-color: #c8c4e8;
        border-radius: 999px;
        padding: 6px 10px;
      }

      .cs-dot {
        width: 6px;
        height: 6px;
        border-radius: 999px;
        background-color: #4f4789;
        opacity: 0.4;
        transition: width 0.25s ease, opacity 0.25s ease;
        flex-shrink: 0;
      }

      .cs-dot.active {
        width: 16px;
        opacity: 1;
      }

      /* ── Features section ── */
      .feature-list {
        list-style: disc;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 12px;
        padding-left: 20px;
      }

      .feature-row {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 16px;
        cursor: pointer;
      }

      .feature-row .body-text {
        flex: 1 1 auto;
      }

      .feature-eye {
        display: inline-block;
        width: 14px;
        height: 14px;
        vertical-align: middle;
        margin-left: 5px;
        position: relative;
        top: -1px;
      }

      .placement-row {
        cursor: pointer;
      }

      .feature-thumb {
        display: none;
      }

      .features-imgs {
        display: flex;
        align-items: flex-end;
        justify-content: center;
        gap: 12px;
      }

      .features-imgs--placement {
        gap: 20px;
      }

      .feature-img-wrap {
        flex: 1 1 0;
        min-width: 0;
        position: relative;
        display: flex;
        align-items: flex-end;
      }

      .feature-img {
        width: 100%;
        height: auto;
        display: block;
        border-radius: 12px;
        transition: transform 0.25s ease, opacity 0.25s ease;
        transform-origin: bottom center;
        cursor: pointer;
      }

      .feature-img-label {
        display: none;
      }

      /* ── Lightbox ── */
      :global(#lightbox) {
        display: none;
        position: fixed;
        inset: 0;
        background: rgba(0,0,0,0.92);
        z-index: 100;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 16px;
        padding: 24px;
      }

      :global(#lightbox.open) { display: flex; }

      :global(#lightbox-img) {
        max-width: 100%;
        max-height: 80vh;
        object-fit: contain;
        border-radius: 4px;
      }

      :global(#lightbox-caption) {
        color: #d8d2f0;
        font-size: 0.8125rem;
        text-align: center;
        max-width: 60ch;
      }

      :global(#lightbox-close) {
        position: fixed;
        top: 20px;
        right: 20px;
        background: none;
        border: none;
        color: #ffffff;
        font-size: 1.5rem;
        cursor: pointer;
        line-height: 1;
        padding: 8px;
      }

      :global(#lightbox-prev),
      :global(#lightbox-next) {
        position: fixed;
        top: 50%;
        transform: translateY(-50%);
        background: none;
        border: none;
        color: #ffffff;
        font-size: 3rem;
        cursor: pointer;
        padding: 8px 16px;
        line-height: 1;
      }

      :global(#lightbox-prev) { left: 8px; }
      :global(#lightbox-next) { right: 8px; }

      /* ── Quotes ── */
      .quote-block {
        border-left: 3px solid #9b90cc;
        padding: 12px 16px;
        background-color: #f3f1fe;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 8px;
      }

      .quote-text {
        font-size: 0.9375rem;
        font-style: italic;
        color: #302b36;
        line-height: 1.6;
      }

      .quote-attr {
        font-size: 0.8125rem;
        color: #827d87;
      }

      .quote-group {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 16px;
      }

      /* ── Callout ── */
      .callout-box {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 20px;
        background-color: #f3f1fe;
        border: 1px solid #d8d2f0;
        padding: 20px 24px;
      }

      .callout-avatar {
        width: 64px;
        height: 64px;
        border-radius: 50%;
        object-fit: cover;
        flex-shrink: 0;
      }

      .callout-text {
        font-size: 0.9375rem;
        color: #302b36;
        line-height: 1.6;
      }

      /* ── Footer ── */
      footer {
        background-color: #eae5fc;
        padding: 24px 24px 40px;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 16px;
      }

      .links {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 8px;
        list-style: none;
      }

      .links a {
        font-size: 0.9375rem;
        font-weight: 400;
      }

      .copyright {
        font-size: 0.8125rem;
        color: #827d87;
        line-height: 1.55;
      }

      /* ── Desktop ── */
      @media (min-width: 640px) {
        .img-frame {
          margin: 0;
          border: 1px solid #d8d2f0;
          padding: 32px;
        }

        .img-frame .wide-img {
          max-width: 360px;
          margin: 0 auto;
        }

        .cs-carousel-frame {
          margin: 0;
          border: 1px solid #d8d2f0;
          padding: 32px 0 36px;
        }

        .cs-slide {
          flex-direction: row;
          align-items: center;
          justify-content: center;
          gap: 40px;
          padding: 0 40px;
        }

        .cs-slide-text {
          flex: 0 0 200px;
        }

        .cs-slide img {
          flex: 0 0 auto;
          width: 360px;
          max-width: none;
        }

        .features-imgs {
          gap: 16px;
        }

        .features-imgs--placement {
          gap: 28px;
        }

        .features-imgs--pricing {
          gap: 32px;
        }

        .features-imgs--pricing .feature-img {
          height: auto;
          width: 100%;
          max-width: 340px;
        }

        .feature-img-wrap {
          flex: 0 0 auto;
        }

        .feature-img {
          height: 360px;
          width: auto;
        }

        .feature-img-label { display: none; }

        :global(#feature-img-cursor-label) {
          position: fixed;
          pointer-events: none;
          z-index: 90;
          display: none;
          background-color: #302b36;
          color: #ffffff;
          font-size: 0.75rem;
          font-weight: 600;
          white-space: nowrap;
          padding: 5px 12px;
          border-radius: 999px;
          opacity: 0;
          transition: opacity 0.15s ease;
        }

        :global(#feature-img-cursor-label.visible) {
          display: block;
          opacity: 1;
        }

        :global(#cursor-preview) {
          position: fixed;
          pointer-events: none;
          z-index: 90;
          display: none;
          border-radius: 12px;
          overflow: hidden;
          transition: opacity 0.15s ease;
          opacity: 0;
          padding: 8px;
          background-color: rgba(243, 241, 254, 0.95);
          box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(155, 144, 204, 0.25), 0 1px 4px rgba(155, 144, 204, 0.12);
        }

        :global(#cursor-preview.visible) {
          display: block;
          opacity: 1;
        }

        :global(#cursor-preview img) {
          height: 220px;
          width: auto;
          display: block;
          border-radius: 6px;
        }


        @media (hover: hover) {
          .feature-img.highlighted {
            transform: scale(1.08);
          }

          .feature-img.dimmed {
            opacity: 0.5;
            transform: scale(0.97);
          }
        }

        .cs-carousel-arrow {
          display: flex;
          align-items: center;
          justify-content: center;
          position: absolute;
          top: 50%;
          transform: translateY(-50%);
          width: 40px;
          height: 40px;
          border-radius: 999px;
          border: none;
          background-color: #eae5fc;
          color: #4f4789;
          cursor: pointer;
          font-size: 1.25rem;
          line-height: 1;
          transition: background-color 0.15s ease;
          z-index: 2;
        }

        .cs-carousel-arrow:hover {
          background-color: #d8d2f0;
        }

        .cs-carousel-arrow--prev { left: 16px; }
        .cs-carousel-arrow--next { right: 16px; }

        .cs-carousel-frame {
          position: relative;
        }
        nav {
          padding: 16px clamp(48px, 8vw, 160px);
        }

        .nav-identity {
          display: flex;
        }

        .nav-identity img {
          width: 34px;
          height: 34px;
        }

        .cs-header {
          padding: 80px clamp(48px, 8vw, 160px) 48px;
          gap: 20px;
        }

        .cs-title {
          font-size: 3rem;
        }

        .cs-body {
          padding: 16px clamp(48px, 8vw, 160px) 80px;
          gap: 48px;
        }

        .cs-section-title {
          font-size: 1.5rem;
        }

        .body-text {
          font-size: 1rem;
          max-width: 68ch;
        }

        .callout-box {
          max-width: 68ch;
        }

        .tldr-box {
          margin: 0;
          padding: 32px;
        }

        .tldr-columns {
          flex-direction: row;
          gap: 48px;
          align-items: flex-start;
        }

        .tldr-left {
          flex: 1 1 0;
          min-width: 0;
        }

        .tldr-box .meta-list {
          flex: 1 1 0;
          min-width: 0;
        }

        .tldr-box p {
          max-width: none;
        }

        .meta-item {
          font-size: 1rem;
        }

        .bullet-list {
          max-width: 68ch;
        }

        .bullet-list li {
          font-size: 1rem;
        }

        .body-list {
          max-width: 68ch;
        }

        .body-list li {
          font-size: 1rem;
        }

        .stat-grid {
          grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
          gap: 32px;
        }

        .stat-number {
          font-size: 2.5rem;
        }

        footer {
          padding: 40px clamp(48px, 8vw, 160px) 56px;
        }

        .links {
          flex-direction: row;
          gap: 32px;
        }

        .quote-group--six {
          flex-direction: row;
          flex-wrap: wrap;
          align-items: flex-start;
          gap: 20px;
        }

        .quote-group--six .quote-block {
          flex: 1 1 calc(50% - 10px);
          min-width: 0;
        }

        .quote-group--six .quote-block--fixed-col {
          flex-grow: 0;
        }
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <nav>
      <a href="/" class="nav-identity">
        <img src="/icon_magda.svg" width="28" height="28" alt="" />
        <span class="nav-name">Magdalena Szymaniec</span>
      </a>
      <div class="nav-links">
        <a href="/" class="nav-link">home</a>
        <a href="/about" class="nav-link">about</a>
      </div>
    </nav>

    <div class="cs-header">
      <span class="cs-year">2025</span>
      <h1 class="cs-title">Blindmate Premium</h1>
      <div class="cs-tags">
        <span class="tag">B2C</span>
        <span class="tag">Monetization</span>
        <span class="tag tag--meta">8 min read</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="cs-body">

      <!-- TL;DR -->
      <div class="tldr-box">
        <p class="tldr-title">TL;DR</p>
        <div class="tldr-columns">
          <div class="tldr-left">
            <p class="body-text">Created a monetization offer for a social dating app, navigating branding constraints (a fair app that promised to be free) and the different <span class="glossary-term" data-term="User roles" data-def="You are a dater (single looking to meet new people), matchmaker (you swipe for your friends) or a dater-matchmaker on Blindmate.">user roles<span class="glossary-tip">You are a dater (single looking to meet new people), matchmaker (you swipe for your friends) or a dater-matchmaker on Blindmate.</span></span>.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="meta-list">
            <p class="meta-item">🏆 <strong>Goal:</strong> Create a monetization model without hurting growth &amp; user trust</p>
            <p class="meta-item">🧑‍🤝‍🧑 <strong>My role:</strong> sole designer on the project collaborating directly with the CEO and lead engineer with support from a user researcher. Whole team of 6 was involved in the ideation.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Stats -->
      <div class="stat-grid">
        <div class="stat">
          <span class="stat-number">2 months</span>
