              <img class="feature-thumb" src="/premium/feature-compatibility.png" alt="Compatibility" data-title="Compatibility" data-feature="compatibility" />
            </div>
          </li>
          <li>
            <div class="feature-row" data-feature="swipes">
              <p class="body-text"><strong>More Swipes</strong><svg class="feature-eye" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M8 4C4.5 4 1.5 6.5 1 8C1.5 9.5 4.5 12 8 12C11.5 12 14.5 9.5 15 8C14.5 6.5 11.5 4 8 4Z" stroke="#9b90cc" stroke-width="1.3" fill="none"/><circle cx="8" cy="8" r="2.2" fill="#9b90cc"/></svg> — gives all of a Single's Matchmakers 3x more daily swipes, letting them find more potential matches.</p>
              <img class="feature-thumb" src="/premium/feature-swipes.png" alt="More Swipes" data-title="More Swipes" data-feature="swipes" />
