      <div class="cs-section">
        <h2 class="cs-section-title">Learnins</h2>
        <p class="body-text">Monetization design goes hand in hand with brand design. Every decision about what to gate, what to surface, and how to frame value is also a decision about what kind of company you are. The most interesting constraint on this project wasn't the timeline or the <span class="glossary-term" data-term="User model" data-def="Singles, Matchmakers, and Dater-Matchmakers — the three roles users can take on Blindmate, each with different motivations and relationships to premium.">user model<span class="glossary-tip">Singles, Matchmakers, and Dater-Matchmakers — the three roles users can take on Blindmate, each with different motivations and relationships to premium.</span></span> — it was designing a revenue stream that users would actually feel good about.</p>
